      "intent": "平行导比例",
      "narration": "$AD \\parallel BH$ 得 $\\frac{AD}{BH}=\\frac{DE}{EH}$，即 $\\frac{x}{2}=\\frac{DE}{EH}$；合比得 $\\frac{DH}{EH}=\\frac{x+2}{2}$，解出 $EH=\\frac{4-2x}{x+2}$。",
